cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MyoSim in academic work, please cite this software."
title: "MyoSim: Reproducible Motor-Intent to Simulated-Action Research Demonstrator"
abstract: "A local-first, software-only, non-clinical platform for deterministic replay of motor-intent events through confidence-aware control, virtual prosthetic simulation, task metrics, and provenance reporting."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "MyoSim Contributors"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.3
date-released: 2026-08-22
keywords:
  - myoelectric control
  - simulation
  - prosthetics
  - MuJoCo
  - reproducibility
